    "name": "Champions League"
  },
  "description": {
    "text": "The Champions League tournaments of the 2027 season, part of the Pokémon Card Game Championship Series 2027. Every player got a holofoil Riolu 155/M-P, and players with four or more wins in total got Mega Zeraora ex 164/M-P. Mega Signal 165/M-P went to master league players with ten or more wins in total and to the top 64 of the junior and senior leagues. All three carry the Championship Series 2027 logo.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: M-P Promotional cards (TCG), card list",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/M-P_Promotional_cards_(TCG)#Card_list"
      }
    ]
  },
